        "id": "3967498737",
        "layout": "vertical",
        "purpose": "example",
        "type": "group"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Derive the rate law for the following reaction mechanism:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "qbeqc5ff41srg8l",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "t2845mfl16betcp",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "8m3luhfk8ac8pss",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\begin{array}{l}\\mathrm{Step}\\;1:\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;{\\mathrm I}_2\\;\\;\\overset{k_1}{\\underset{k_{-1}}\\rightleftharpoons} \\;\\;2\\;\\mathrm I\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;(\\mathrm{fast},\\;\\mathrm{reversible})\\\\\\underline{\\mathrm{Step}\\;2:\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;{\\mathrm H}_2\\;+\\;2\\;\\mathrm I \\;\\;\\xrightarrow{k_2}\\;\\;2\\;\\mathrm{HI}\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;(\\mathrm{slow})\\;\\;\\;}\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\\\\\mathrm{Overall}:\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;{\\mathrm H}_2 \\;+\\;{\\mathrm I}_2\\;\\;\\xrightarrow k\\;\\;2\\;\\mathrm{HI}\\end{array}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The rate law for reaction is determined by the rate law for step 2, the slow step:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "3by8nl490sy8ao5",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "se4sjdre0kyby34",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "hzvz9f6x3fjbrl6",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\mathrm{Rate}\\;=\\;{\\mathrm{Rate}}_2\\;=\\;k_2\\lbrack{\\mathrm H}_2\\rbrack\\lbrack\\mathrm I\\rbrack^2",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The intermediate, I, cannot be included in the rate law for the overall reaction, so we must derive [I] from the first step."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "63dhkk8hk6y1j8n",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Step 1 is reversible, so the rate of the forward reaction is equal to the rate of the reverse reaction:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "vkkxjmg1of8o770",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "o99149tpcxyc163",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "a58wupii2itvka5",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\begin{array}{c}{\\mathrm{Rate}}_1\\;=\\;\\;{\\mathrm{Rate}}_{-1}\\\\{\\mathrm{Rate}}_1\\;=\\;k_1\\lbrack{\\mathrm I}_2\\rbrack\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\; \\mathrm{and}\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;{\\mathrm{Rate}}_{-1}\\;=\\;k_{-1}\\lbrack\\mathrm I\\rbrack^2\\\\\\mathit\\Rightarrow\\mathit\\;\\mathit\\;\\mathit\\;\\mathit \\;k_1\\lbrack{\\mathrm I}_2\\rbrack\\;=\\;k_{-1}\\lbrack\\mathrm I\\rbrack^2\\end{array}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Solving for [I]:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "vk2673xozoifk4r",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "o7it1aqcc7u53z3",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "u6fdgrwiube604k",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\lbrack\\mathrm I\\rbrack\\;=\\;\\sqrt{\\frac{k_1}{k_{-1}}\\lbrack{\\mathrm I}_2\\rbrack}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Substituting [I] into the rate law for the rate-determining step:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "ogj3ak19f16ybtc",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "ib433ykyro0skpq",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "yrm5n7r10jd8wcb",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\mathrm{Rate}\\;=\\;k_2\\lbrack{\\mathrm H}_2\\rbrack\\lbrack\\mathrm I{\\rbrack^2\\;=\\;\\;k_2\\lbrack{\\mathrm H}_2\\rbrack\\left(\\sqrt{\\frac{k_1} {k_{-1}}\\lbrack{\\mathrm I}_2\\rbrack}\\right)^2\\;=\\;}k_2\\lbrack{\\mathrm H}_2\\rbrack\\frac{k_1}{k_{-1}}\\lbrack{\\mathrm I}_2\\rbrack",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Combining the rate constants for the steps into a single rate constant gives the rate law for the mechanism:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "dhiynxh39e50rhd",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "4edso1gedz8wxdj",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "iwgn8u4s2firt2n",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\mathrm{Rate}\\;=\\;k\\lbrack{\\mathrm H}_2\\rbrack\\lbrack{\\mathrm I}_2\\rbrack",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The rate law for this proposed mechanism is the same as the known rate law, so this is a possible mechanism for the reaction."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "5mhc5vrfuzthge7",
                "type": "p"
              }
